        "chapter": 3,
        "title": "The Time Management Matrix",
        "summary": "Explanation of Covey's time management matrix, categorizing tasks into four quadrants (urgent/important, not urgent/not important, urgent/important, and not urgent/not important).",
        "part": ""
      },
      {
